From 62ec363992b371f974ac624b0e57339e65957fb7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TekRantGaming <craigferels896@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 21:47:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] D3D12: ambient occlusion under the title's fog darkens only
 the scene part

King Kong draws its distance fog before the scene copy the AO goes into, so fogged walls showed their AO through the fog. The command processor notes the constants of the title's fog pass (its two AfterEffects fog shaders, c0 fog color, c1 g_vFogParams, c2 g_vFogNormalizing); the AO works out the same fog amount per pixel and applies color * ao + fog color * fog * (1 - ao). REX_DEV_AO_TRACE also logs the fog constants.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
